OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly bright spells will give
OL,6,Fway to increasing cloud and some rain
OL,7,Ffrom the west on Thursday morning, and
OL,8,Fthis will lead into a rather wet and
OL,9,Fbreezy afternoon. The strongest winds
OL,10,Fwill be around coasts and over high
OL,11,Fground.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe heaviest of the rain will
OL,14,Fclear eastwards this evening, leaving
OL,15,Fshowers for a time, these easing by
OL,16,Fdawn with some clearer spells. A
OL,17,Fmilder night than the previous night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
