OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FIsolated showers first thing
OL,6,FFriday morning, but dissipating under
OL,7,Fa ridge of high pressure. This leaves
OL,8,Fbrighter spells in the afternoon,
OL,9,Fespecially in the west. Temperatures
OL,10,Fwill be near average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMore
OL,13,Fwet and windy weather returns on
OL,14,FSaturday, followed by another ridge of
OL,15,Fhigh pressure and drier weather on
OL,16,FSunday. Staying autumnal into next
OL,17,Fweek with further spells of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
